[PREFIX: HLP]
================================================================================
TICKETS - BUG & SUGGESTION TRACKER (SAMPLE FILE)
================================================================================
This is a sample file demonstrating the syntax highlighting and features.
Save your project task lists with the '.tickets' or '.tkt' extension to activate.
===============================================================================
RULES & CONVENTIONS:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Prefixes (Start of line triggers):
  $- : Completed / final / no testing required
  @- : Working on it
  #- : Fixed and ready to test
  *- : Planned for later (Backlog)
  !- : Irrelevant or cancelled
  ^- : Fails testing / needs rework
  ~- : Epic / Milestones / Undecided

Tags (Inline badges):
  [BUG] or [B]   : Bug fixes
  [FT] or [F]    : New features
  [ENH] or [E]   : Improvements/enhancements
  [EPIC] or [EP] : Large milestones
  [SUB]           : Direct sub-ticket; requires -- and a [FT], [BUG], or [ENH] parent
  [TEST]          : Test case; requires a child [LINK]
  [LINK]          : One or more workspace ticket references

Description (Italics):
  [DESC] *Use description lines for additional details and file paths/attachments.*

Comments:
  // single line comment - can be added at the end of the ticket lines.
  /* multiline comment
    can be on multiple line
    to add large comments
  */
================================================================================
Examples -
~- [EPIC][HLP-0001] Phase 1: Authentication & Layout
  [DESC] *Core auth modules. Design document: docs/auth_design.md*
  $- [FT][HLP-0002] Initial user registration and password hashing // Complete
  $- [FT][HLP-0003] Responsive dashboard panel with glassmorphism theme // Complete
  @- [FT][HLP-0004] OAuth integration with Google & Github // Currently working on config
  #- [BUG][HLP-0005] Fix login spinner hang on slow network connections // Ready to test!
  [DESC] *See screenshot of error hang at docs/evidences/login_hang.png*
  ^- [BUG][HLP-0006] Profile avatar upload exceeds memory limit on large files // Failed testing
  [DESC] *Fails on files > 10MB. Spec: https://api.example.com/spec*

~- [EPIC][HLP-0007] Phase 2: Billing & Subscriptions
  *- [FT][HLP-0008] Integrate Stripe payment gateway
    -- [SUB][HLP-0011] Add saved payment-method selector
  *- [ENH][HLP-0009] Add support for recurring monthly subscriptions // Backlog item

!- [FT][HLP-0010] Legacy XML data parser migration // Cancelled (switching entirely to JSON APIs)

@- [FT][HLP-0012] Add account recovery workflow
  -- [SUB][HLP-0013] Create the recovery request form
  $- -- [SUB][HLP-0014] Add expiring recovery tokens // Completed sub-ticket
  #- [TEST][HLP-0015] Verify successful account recovery
    [LINK] [HLP-0012][HLP-0014][HLP-0009]
  *- [TEST][HLP-0016] Verify recovery for an unknown account
    [LINK]{nil}

/*
  Block comments like this are fully supported.
  Use them for general notes, release logs, or design drafts.
*/
